{"seq":2,"slug":"finetuning-roi-model","title":"微调的 ROI 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/finetuning-roi-model","wordCount":2145,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"微调的-roi-模型\">微调的 ROI 模型</h1><p>“要不要微调”这个问题在 2026 年的真实答案，几乎从不取决于微调能不能让模型变得更准——它几乎总能。真正决定成败的是一道算术题：一次性的训练支出，加上比基座更贵的推理单价，能不能被“每次请求少发的那几千个 prompt token”赚回来，以及多久赚回来。本文把这道题拆成可以直接套数字的成本结构、盈亏平衡公式与决策门槛，并用 2026 年各家真实定价做锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-微调省的是-请求级开销-不是-知识\">核心概念：微调省的是「请求级开销」，不是「知识」</h2><p>2026 年业界对微调的定位已经收敛成一句话：<strong>fine-tuning is for form, not facts</strong>——微调用来固化风格、结构化输出、拒答模式与领域语气，而不是用来灌输每周都会变的事实知识；后者属于 RAG（<a href=\"https://bigdataboutique.com/blog/fine-tuning-llms-when-rag-isnt-enough\">BigData Boutique, 2026</a>）。推荐的工程顺序是 Prompt → RAG → Fine-tune → Distill，最高 ROI 的微调通常是在强基座之上挂一个薄薄的 LoRA/QLoRA adapter，并与检索并存而非替代检索（<a href=\"https://dev.to/muzammil_endevsols/rag-vs-fine-tuning-vs-prompting-2026-strategic-guide-169l\">DEV Community, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>理解 ROI 的关键，是看清微调到底改变了哪条成本曲线。微调的经济价值主要来自<strong>把一段每次请求都要重发的长 system prompt“烧”进权重</strong>：原本每次调用都要付费的几千个指令 token，微调后可以从请求里删掉。换句话说，它把“按次重复的可变成本”换成了“一次性的固定成本加略高的单价”。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[需求: 稳定风格/结构化输出/&lt;br/&gt;每次重发长 prompt] --&gt; B{知识是否每周变?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 动态事实| C[RAG: 检索注入&lt;br/&gt;不要微调]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 是形态| D{请求量是否够大?}&#10;  D --&gt;|月 &lt; 5 万次| E[继续 Prompt/RAG&lt;br/&gt;微调难回本]&#10;  D --&gt;|月 &gt; 5 万次| F[LoRA/QLoRA 微调&lt;br/&gt;删长 prompt]&#10;  F --&gt; G{准确率在前沿 2-3 点内?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[蒸馏到小模型&lt;br/&gt;推理再降 12-40x]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[保留基座 + 微调 adapter]\">flowchart TD\n  A[需求: 稳定风格/结构化输出/&lt;br/&gt;每次重发长 prompt] --&gt; B{知识是否每周变?}\n  B --&gt;|是, 动态事实| C[RAG: 检索注入&lt;br/&gt;不要微调]\n  B --&gt;|否, 是形态| D{请求量是否够大?}\n  D --&gt;|月 &lt; 5 万次| E[继续 Prompt/RAG&lt;br/&gt;微调难回本]\n  D --&gt;|月 &gt; 5 万次| F[LoRA/QLoRA 微调&lt;br/&gt;删长 prompt]\n  F --&gt; G{准确率在前沿 2-3 点内?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[蒸馏到小模型&lt;br/&gt;推理再降 12-40x]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[保留基座 + 微调 adapter]</pre><p>下表对比三条路线在 2026 年的成本特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>一次性成本</th>\n<th>推理单价</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>典型回本周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 Prompt</td>\n<td>近 0</td>\n<td>基座价 + 长 prompt 重复开销</td>\n<td>量小、需求多变</td>\n<td>不涉及</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>中（向量库/管道）</td>\n<td>基座价 + 检索 token</td>\n<td>动态事实、需引用</td>\n<td>看检索基建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRA/QLoRA 微调</td>\n<td>低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500–</span></span></span></span></span>5,000）</td>\n<td>基座的 2–3x</td>\n<td>固定形态、高频</td>\n<td>1–3 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调 + 蒸馏到小模型</td>\n<td>中（训练 + 蒸馏）</td>\n<td>12–40x 更便宜</td>\n<td>窄任务、超高频</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LoRA 相比全量微调能把算力成本降低 50–80%，质量损失极小，典型项目落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500–</span></span></span></span></span>5,000 区间（<a href=\"https://www.stratagem-systems.com/blog/lora-fine-tuning-cost-analysis-2026\">Stratagem Systems, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本结构-把训练-推理-运维三块拆开\">成本结构：把训练、推理、运维三块拆开</h2><p>微调的总拥有成本（TCO）不是一个数字，而是三段叠加。第一段是<strong>训练成本</strong>，按训练 token 计费。以 OpenAI 为例，GPT-4o 微调训练为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>；而</mtext><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4.1</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mtext>训练仅</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25/百万 token；而 GPT-4.1 Nano 训练仅</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；而</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GP</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">训练仅</span></span></span></span></span>0.20/百万 token，比 GPT-4o 便宜约 125 倍（<a href=\"https://pricepertoken.com/fine-tuning\">Price Per Token, 2026</a>）。一个 10 万 token、跑 3 个 epoch 的 GPT-4o-mini 微调任务，训练成本大约只有 $0.90（<a href=\"https://aicostcheck.com/blog/ai-fine-tuning-costs-2026\">AI Cost Check, 2026</a>）。训练这一块在多数项目里其实是最小的一项。</p>\n<p>第二段是<strong>推理溢价</strong>，这是最容易被低估的成本。微调模型的推理单价通常是基座的 2–3 倍：微调后的 GPT-4.1 推理约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万输入</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>、</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.00/百万输入 token、</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.00/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万输入</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span></span></span></span></span>12.00/百万输出 token，明显贵于基座（<a href=\"https://aicostcheck.com/blog/ai-fine-tuning-costs-2026\">AI Cost Check, 2026</a>）。这意味着如果你删掉的 prompt token 不够多、请求量不够大，更贵的单价会把省下的钱反向吃掉。</p>\n<p>第三段是<strong>运维税（operational tax）</strong>——adapter 版本管理、回滚预案、重训练节奏、基座漂移应对，都是周期性支出。一个务实的经验法则是：未来 12 个月的生命周期持有成本，按训练成本的 3–5 倍来预算（<a href=\"https://dev.to/muzammil_endevsols/rag-vs-fine-tuning-vs-prompting-2026-strategic-guide-169l\">DEV Community, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>设单次请求删掉的 prompt token 数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，基座输入单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，微调后输入单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{ft}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则每次请求的净节省为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Saving</mtext><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Saving}_{req} = T_p \\cdot p_{in} - V_{out} \\cdot (p_{ft} - p_{in})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均输出 token 数。注意第二项是<strong>负贡献</strong>——输出越长、推理溢价越高，微调省的钱越少。这条公式解释了为什么微调最适合“长 prompt、短输出、高并发”的形态化任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"盈亏平衡-把训练成本除以单次净节省\">盈亏平衡：把训练成本除以单次净节省</h2><p>有了单次净节省，盈亏平衡点就是一道除法。设训练加首期运维的一次性成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{fix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则需要的累计请求数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>Saving</mtext><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{breakeven} = \\frac{C_{fix}}{\\text{Saving}_{req}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4266em;vertical-align:-1.0662em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0662em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 2026 年的真实数字代进去会很有冲击力。一个典型测算：在 GPT-4o mini <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>百万输入</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>的价位下，删掉一段</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>的</mtext><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>，每次请求省</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.30/百万输入 token 的价位下，删掉一段 2,000 token 的 prompt，每次请求省</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">百万输入</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的价位下，删掉一段</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，每次请求省</span></span></span></span></span>0.00078，在 5,000 请求/天的量下，约 23 天回本（<a href=\"https://digiqt.com/tools/fine-tuning-cost/\">Digiqt, 2026</a>）。另一个更极端的例子：前述 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.90</mn><mtext>的训练成本，如果让每次请求少发</mtext><mn>400</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>、每</mtext><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>000</mn><mtext>次请求省</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.90 的训练成本，如果让每次请求少发 400 token、每 1,000 次请求省</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的训练成本，如果让每次请求少发</span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、每</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次请求省</span></span></span></span></span>0.12，在 10,000 请求/天时，训练成本不到一天就赚回来了（<a href=\"https://aicostcheck.com/blog/ai-fine-tuning-costs-2026\">AI Cost Check, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>行业给出的“三个同时满足才值得微调”的门槛是：每次调用都要重发 3,000+ token 的长 system prompt、月请求量 50,000+、且有 1,000+ 条高质量训练样本——满足时典型回本为 1–3 个月（<a href=\"https://digiqt.com/tools/fine-tuning-cost/\">Digiqt, 2026</a>）。下面这张表给出几个量级下的回本直觉（删 2,000 token、GPT-4o mini 价位）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>请求量/天</th>\n<th>每日节省</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>回本天数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1,000</td>\n<td>$0.78</td>\n<td>~$0.90</td>\n<td>~1.2 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>$3.90</td>\n<td>~$0.90</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>~$2.25（删 500 token）</td>\n<td>~$1</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注：50,000 请求/天、删 500 输入 token 约省 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>天即</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.25/天即</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天即</span></span></span></span></span>821/年（<a href=\"https://digiqt.com/tools/fine-tuning-cost/\">Digiqt, 2026</a>）。可见一旦请求量上量，训练成本几乎可以忽略，真正的胜负手反而落在推理溢价与运维税上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蒸馏的二阶-roi-把窄任务压进小模型\">蒸馏的二阶 ROI：把窄任务压进小模型</h2><p>当微调后的准确率已经逼近前沿模型，下一步的杠杆不是再调，而是<strong>蒸馏</strong>——用前沿模型当 teacher，把能力压进一个更小的 student 模型，从而砍推理成本。2026 年的典型测算是：一个 13B 参数的微调/蒸馏模型，只要落在前沿模型准确率的两个百分点以内，单 token 推理成本可比前沿便宜 12 到 40 倍（<a href=\"https://sfailabs.com/guides/the-ai-project-distillation-case-when-a-smaller-fine-tune-beats-a-bigger-model\">SFAI Labs, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>蒸馏的 ROI 有一个明确的“可辩护区间”：生产 eval 集上掉 2–3 个百分点是大多数企业负载的合理操作范围。掉不到 2 个百分点，说明蒸馏过度工程化了；掉超过 3 个百分点，用户体验损失开始压过推理省下的钱（<a href=\"https://sfailabs.com/guides/the-ai-project-distillation-case-when-a-smaller-fine-tune-beats-a-bigger-model\">SFAI Labs, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>2026 年成熟栈里流行的是“模型阶梯”路由：前沿 teacher 只接最难的 5% 流量，蒸馏出的中型模型扛 80%，更小的模型走缓存或简单路径（<a href=\"https://redis.io/blog/model-distillation-llm-guide/\">Redis, 2026</a>）。蒸馏成本也能降 GPU 需求 50–75%（<a href=\"https://www.mirantis.com/blog/inference-costs/\">Mirantis, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[全部请求] --&gt; B{难度路由}&#10;  B --&gt;|最难 5%| C[前沿 teacher 模型]&#10;  B --&gt;|主流 80%| D[蒸馏中型模型&lt;br/&gt;掉 2-3 点 / 省 12-40x]&#10;  B --&gt;|简单/缓存 15%| E[小模型或缓存]&#10;  C --&gt; F[聚合输出]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[全部请求] --&gt; B{难度路由}\n  B --&gt;|最难 5%| C[前沿 teacher 模型]\n  B --&gt;|主流 80%| D[蒸馏中型模型&lt;br/&gt;掉 2-3 点 / 省 12-40x]\n  B --&gt;|简单/缓存 15%| E[小模型或缓存]\n  C --&gt; F[聚合输出]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"平台风险-微调资产会因供应商下线而归零\">平台风险：微调资产会因供应商下线而归零</h2><p>2026 年微调 ROI 模型里必须计入一个非财务变量——<strong>供应商生命周期风险</strong>。截至 2026 年 5 月 8 日，OpenAI 正在关停其微调平台：新用户已无法访问，存量用户也只剩接下来几个月可以创建训练任务（<a href=\"https://pricepertoken.com/fine-tuning\">Price Per Token, 2026</a>）。这意味着把核心资产押在某一家闭源微调平台上，回本周期再短，也可能因为平台下线而前功尽弃。</p>\n<p>这把决策的天平推向两个方向：要么用开源权重自托管 LoRA（资产可迁移、可长期持有），要么在 ROI 测算里给闭源微调资产打一个“折旧/迁移”系数。一个降本却也加深锁定的选项是：OpenAI 对开启数据共享的微调推理给 50% 折扣，适合非敏感负载（<a href=\"https://aicostcheck.com/blog/ai-fine-tuning-costs-2026\">AI Cost Check, 2026</a>）——省钱的同时要权衡数据与锁定成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>微调的 ROI 本质是一道算术题：一次性训练成本 + 推理溢价，能否被“每次请求删掉的 prompt token”赚回。它省的是请求级重复开销，不是知识。</li>\n<li>成本三段：训练（最小，GPT-4o-mini 一个任务约 $0.90）、推理溢价（基座的 2–3 倍，最易低估）、运维税（按训练成本 3–5 倍预算 12 个月）。</li>\n<li>盈亏平衡 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mtext>Saving</mtext><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{breakeven} = C_{fix} / \\text{Saving}_{req}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Saving</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；行业门槛是 3,000+ token 长 prompt、月 50,000+ 请求、1,000+ 样本同时满足，回本 1–3 个月。一旦上量，训练成本可忽略，胜负落在推理溢价与运维。</li>\n<li>二阶杠杆是蒸馏：准确率在前沿 2–3 点内时，推理可便宜 12–40 倍；掉超过 3 点则得不偿失。模型阶梯路由（5%/80%/15%）是 2026 主流。</li>\n<li>务必把供应商下线风险计入模型——OpenAI 微调平台 2026-05-08 起关停，闭源微调资产可能归零；自托管 LoRA 或加迁移折旧系数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微调的 ROI 模型","id":"微调的-roi-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：微调省的是「请求级开销」，不是「知识」","id":"核心概念-微调省的是-请求级开销-不是-知识"},{"level":2,"text":"成本结构：把训练、推理、运维三块拆开","id":"成本结构-把训练-推理-运维三块拆开"},{"level":2,"text":"盈亏平衡：把训练成本除以单次净节省","id":"盈亏平衡-把训练成本除以单次净节省"},{"level":2,"text":"蒸馏的二阶 ROI：把窄任务压进小模型","id":"蒸馏的二阶-roi-把窄任务压进小模型"},{"level":2,"text":"平台风险：微调资产会因供应商下线而归零","id":"平台风险-微调资产会因供应商下线而归零"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自建与采购的决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/build-vs-buy-framework"},"next":{"title":"开源与闭源模型的成本权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/build-vs-buy-and-finetuning-roi/open-source-vs-proprietary"}}